              </p>
              <h3>Changes</h3>
              <p>These terms may be updated over time. Continued use after changes means you accept the revised terms.</p>
            </Section>

            <Section id="cookies" title="Cookie Policy">
              <p><em>Effective: March 2026</em></p>
              <h3>What We Use</h3>
